# cjxl parity ledger — W44-79 refresh post W44-78 (high_d_photo_min_distance 4.0→3.0)
#
# W44-78 (`a01c4a7f`) shipped `HIGH_D_PHOTO_MIN_DISTANCE: 4.0 → 3.0`, closing
# 1420710 e7 d=3 OPEN→FIXED (-1675 B). Net -2564 B across 5 cells, zero
# `FIXED → OPEN` flips.
#
# This refresh re-runs only the 16 OPEN cells from the W44-74 baseline to
# confirm post-W44-78 status, plus 3 spot-checks for the cells W44-68/W44-73/W44-78
# previously closed:
#   - 1420710.png e7 d=3 (W44-78 target):     FIXED, bytes_delta -0.17%  (was +4.62% pre-W44-78)
#   - 1420710.png e7 d=6 (W44-73 closure):    FIXED, bytes_delta +2.71%
#   - codec_wiki.png e7 d=4 (W44-68 closure): FIXED, bytes_delta -1.24%
#
